ser2netweb shares serial ports over the network: raw TCP, telnet, RFC 2217,
UDP, a Modbus RTU/TCP gateway and MQTT, configured in a web UI or over a REST
API, with user accounts, an audit log and clustering of several nodes.

ser2netweb is an independent project, unrelated to Corey Minyard's ser2net
(comms/ser2net); both can be installed.
